# T7a follow-up D7: clearing a clip that is playing stops that role (which releases its notes).
wait 300
tap SEQ
tap HOME
tap SEL
expect liveque0 0
tap PLAY
wait-bar 1
expect liveclip0 0
wait 1400
shot studio_clearplay_before.png
press HOME
key w0 down
wait 1600
key w0 up
release HOME
expect clipused0 0
wait-bar 2
expect liveclip0 -1
shot studio_clearplay_after.png
dump studio_clearplay.json
tap PLAY
